[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/ariallg90-gif/gta6-01/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)

**Solano Streets** — an open-world crime game in the sun-soaked city of Port Solano. Milo Vance owes Big Sal Greco $50,000, and five story jobs are the only way out: pick up fares, steal the red Comet GT, settle a score with the Vultures at the Old Cannery, outrun the Solano PD at five wanted stars, and run one last package to the harbour boat.

Explore the city on foot or behind the wheel, carjack traffic, dodge (or ram) police interceptors, fight gang members, pick up cash, and watch the wanted level rise and cool off. A live minimap, mission markers, health and cash HUD, procedural WebAudio sound, and autosave after every job.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080

